<title>INDIA: WSC-India Rice Weather, Oct 8.</title>
<headline>WSC-India Rice Weather, Oct 8.</headline>
<text>
<p>SUMMARY- Mostly dry weather was reported. Highs 81-99F (27-37C).</p>
<p>CROP IMPACT- Mostly favorable conditions for the development of rice at this time.</p>
<p>FORECAST-</p>
<p>TODAY...Scattered showers and thunderstorms of 0.25-0.75 inch (6-18mm) in the south. Isolated thunderstorms of up to 0.30 inch (7mm) in the northeast. Mostly sunny to partly cloudy and warm over the remainder of India with little in the way of shower activity. Highs 82-100F (27-38C).</p>
<p>TONIGHT...Some lingering showers in the far southeast, otherwise mostly clear to partly cloudy and warm. Lows 66-77F (19-25C).</p>
<p>TOMORROW...Little change from today's weather expected.</p>
<p>OUTLOOK...No major changes with the brunt of the shower and thunderstorm activity in the south, favoring the far southeast. Isolated thunderstorms are possible daily in the northeast. Temperatures average near to above normal.</p>
<p>Source: Weather Services Corporation</p>
</text>
